1,Indo-European languages - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indo-European_languages,"The Indo-European family is significant to the field of historical linguistics as it possesses the second-longest recorded history of any known family after Egyptian and the Semitic languages, which belong to the Afroasiatic language family.",Gazi,Indo-European
